{title: 315 - O for a Closer Walk!}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #315 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 315}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Am]O for acloser [F]walk with [Dm/F]God,
[Dm]A calm [Gm]and [Gbm]heavenlyframe,
[C/E]Alight [F]toshine [Dm/F]upon [Gm]the [Dm/A]road
[Am/C]That leads [Gm/Bb]me to [Dm/A]the Lamb!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Am]Return, O [Gm/Bb]holy [F]Dove, return,
[Dm]Sweet messenger [Db/Ab]of [Dm/A]rest!
[C/E]I [F]hate the [Bb/F]sins [Dm/F]that [C/G]made [Gm]Thee [Dm/A]mourn
[Am/C]And drove [Gm/Bb]Thee from [Dm/A]my breast.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Am]What peaceful [Dm/A]hours [F]I once [Dm/F]enjoyed!
[Dm]How sweet [Gm]their [Gbm]memory [Dm/A]still!
[C/E]But [F]they have [Bb/F]left [Dm/F]an [C/G]aching [Dm/A]void
[Am/C]The world [Gm/Bb]can never [Dm/A]fill.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Am]The dearest [Gm/Bb]idol [F]I have [Dm/F]known,
[Dm]Whate'er [Gm]that idol [Dm/A]be
[C/E]Help [F]me to [Bb/F]tear [Dm/F]it [C/G]from [Gm]Thy [Dm/A]throne,
[Am/C]And worship [Gm/Bb]only [Dm/A]Thee.
{end_of_verse}
